WEBVTT

00:10.000 --> 00:11.000
I won!

00:11.080 --> 00:12.480
Is there a prize?

00:13.240 --> 00:14.600
Defeated by a woman...

00:14.800 --> 00:16.200
Uncle,

00:16.600 --> 00:19.000
It was merely meant to enliven the mood before the banquet.

00:19.080 --> 00:20.040
Young General Zu

00:20.120 --> 00:21.920
did not hold back in the slightest.

00:22.000 --> 00:22.760
The Prince of Jin

00:22.840 --> 00:24.240
is of noble imperial blood;

00:24.320 --> 00:25.280
his foundation and form

00:25.360 --> 00:26.680
are truly first-rate.

00:26.760 --> 00:27.360
It is just that my daughter

00:27.440 --> 00:29.360
has fought long on the northern frontier,

00:29.440 --> 00:31.240
where life and death turn in an instant.

00:31.320 --> 00:32.160
When her blade strikes,

00:32.240 --> 00:33.520
she knows not how to pull her punches.

00:33.600 --> 00:35.200
I beg Your Highness's forgiveness for our offense.

00:35.280 --> 00:36.520
A fierce tiger breeds no timid cub!

00:36.600 --> 00:38.000
Young General Zu,

00:38.600 --> 00:40.267
you have my deepest respect.

00:40.880 --> 00:42.680
His Majesty arrives!
